t she just killed  her two children  now the father has set up a gofundme  page for his two children  and in a statement he says quote our  kids  had so much life ahead of them and we  wanted to see them prosper in whatever  they wanted to do in life  they would be truly missed as our hearts  are hurting right now  unquote that gofundme page can be found  on our website eight newsnow dot com  reporting live in henderson sally  jaramillo  8 news now
 

